WHAT YOU MAY DO

Free of charge, you may:

1. Download the Software from its official channels: its CurseForge and Wago pages, and its GitHub
   repository at https://github.com/powercover/BetterGreatVault. This includes add-on managers
   that install it from those channels.
2. Install and use the Software as an add-on for World of Warcraft.
3. Read its source code, and change your own installed copy for your own use, as long as you do
   not share the changed copy.
4. View and fork the GitHub repository as GitHub's Terms of Service allow. A fork grants no rights
   beyond the ones in this license.


