2. Publish modified versions of the Software, or works based on it.
3. Reuse its code, artwork, textures or translations in other projects.
4. Sell the Software, charge for access to it or for services built on it, or use it commercially
   in any other way.
5. Remove or change its copyright, license or author notices.


